  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2605.09 Records of Sale of Display or Consumer Fireworks",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2605.09 Records of Sale of Display or Consumer Fireworks.\n\n(a) Any person who has a state license pursuant to RSA 160-B, shall only sell display fireworks to a person who shows a certificate of competency issued pursuant to RSA 158:9-f, or who shows a license for the storage of display fireworks issued pursuant to RSA 158:9-c and Saf-C 1600, or who shows a license to sell display and consumer fireworks pursuant to RSA 160-B and this chapter.\n\n(b) In the case of a sale of any display or consumer fireworks, the seller shall record the following:\n\n(1) The name and address of the purchaser of the display or consumer fireworks;\n\n(2) The purchaser’s certificate of competency license number, if applicable;\n\n(3) The purchaser’s license number for the storage of display fireworks;\n\n(4) In the case of a wholesale sale:\n\na. The purchaser’s retail number from the state of residence; and\n\nb. IRS tax identification number;\n\n(5) The date of the transfer;\n\n(6) The type and quantity of display and consumer fireworks;\n\n(7) The serial number of the display and consumer fireworks, if any; and\n\n(8) The purpose to which the display and consumer fireworks are to be used.\n\n(c) Each record of a sale of display or consumer fireworks shall include:\n\n(1) In the case of a sale to a purchaser with a certificate of competency license:\n\na. A copy of the purchaser’s display permit; and\n\nb. A copy of the purchaser’s certificate of competency license;\n\nc. In the case of a wholesale sale, a copy of the purchaser’s retail license or permit from the state of residence;\n\n(2) In the case of a purchaser who shows a license for the storage of display fireworks, a copy of the purchaser’s license to store display fireworks, issued pursuant to RSA 158:9-c and Saf-C 1600.\n\n(d) The records pursuant this section shall be kept by the seller for a period of 2 years.\n\nSource. #10784, eff 2-13-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c2600.html"
}
